[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2464840206","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98962#issuecomment-2464840206","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98962","id":2464840206,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S6noO","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T14:01:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T14:01:12Z","body":"Most likely something in the Steam Runtime environment is preventing access to the xdg-desktop-portal or system D-Bus interface in general, and not providing it's own equivalent.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2464840206/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468079116","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98962#issuecomment-2468079116","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98962","id":2468079116,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TG-YM","user":{"login":"romlok","id":441188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTE4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/441188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok","html_url":"https://github.com/romlok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T12:36:43Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T12:36:43Z","body":"I've looked into this a little more, and it appears that Godot is indeed now running in one of Steam's containerised Linux runtimes, where it wasn't doing so before (the \"Legacy runtime\").\r\nThere doesn't seem to be a way to reverse this on a per-game basis, but (for now) one can disable the enforced runtime by running the Steam client with `-compat-force-slr off`.\r\n\r\nIn announcing this change, IIRC Valve mentioned that developers could choose which runtime to use for their app/game.  So is it an option for Godot on Steam to be configured not to use a containerised runtime?\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468079116/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525074471","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98962#issuecomment-2525074471","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98962","id":2525074471,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WgZQn","user":{"login":"romlok","id":441188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTE4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/441188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok","html_url":"https://github.com/romlok","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romlok/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-07T11:10:42Z","updated_at":"2024-12-07T11:10:42Z","body":"The Blender team recently posted on Steam about this same issue, and now have a known issue note in their [Steam documentation](https://developer.blender.org/docs/handbook/release_process/stores/steam/#known-issues):\n\n> Valve recently changed how applications run on Linux. It now defaults to run applications inside a Steam Linux Runtime. This has some consequences, known issues are:\n>\n>    Cycles GPU rendering crashes or cannot find GPUs to render on. [#129895](https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/issues/129895)\n>    System Volumes are not visible inside the Blender File Browser [#129902](https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/issues/129902)\n\nFrom their notes, it seems like a more fine-grained fix/workaround could be coming in a future Steam update:\n\n> Disable it for Blender only (requires the latest Steam Client beta update): Properties → Compatibility → Force the use of... → Legacy runtime 1.0\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2525074471/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]